---
title: "{% if title|length > title_length %}{{ title|slice(0,title_length) }}...{% else %}{{ title }}{% endif %}"
date: {{ date }}
icon: rss
source: RSS
src_url: {{ url }}
domains:
  - {{ host }}
{{ year }}: "{{ month }}"
{% if categories|length > 0 or tags|length > 0 %}categories:
{% for category in categories %}
  - {{ category }}
{% endfor %}
{% for tag in tags %}
  - {{ tag }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
---
Het oorspronkelijke artikel kan je lezen op [{{ host }}]({{ url }}).
